flowchart TD
  A[WIRE.OUT / API POST /wires] --> B[WIREXFR0]
  B --> C{function}
  C -->|SEND or RECV| D[CALL OFACCHK0]
  C -->|COMP| E[PR to CP 确认]
  C -->|RVRS| F[冲正]
  C -->|INQY| G[查询返回]
  D -->|HIT| H[拒绝 E0101]
  D -->|CLEAR| I{amount > 50000}
  I -->|是| J[双人授权]
  I -->|否| K[FILEIO0 记 WIRE + 账户]
  J --> K
  K --> L[待清算]

  M[ACH.IN] --> N[ACHRECV0]
  N --> O[CALL REGDCHK0]
  O --> P[CALL OFACCHK0]
  P --> Q[入账]
  Q --> R[CALL AUDTLOG0]
  R -->|R01-R09| S[退回码]

  T[EOD.TRIGGER] --> U[EODPROC0]
  U --> V[INTCALC0]
  V --> W[TXNPOST0]
  W --> X[GLPOST0 试算]
  X -->|不平| Y[RC 8 停月末]
  X -->|平| Z[AUDTLOG0]
  Z --> AA[月末才跑 EOMPROC0 FEECALC0]
